{"Background":{"Text":"Kinch spent 200 years as a jedi training droid on Coruscant, always knowing there had to be a better target for his violence than the nice children he was tasked with fighting. One day he heard a master say, \"sometimes, one must take destiny into their own hands\" and he had an epiphany - later that night, Kinch cornered the master alone and unarmed, and left him covered in Discouraging Wounds before leaping out of a window into a speeder which was passing below by \"chance\". Ever since that night, Kinch has seized fate by the throat in pursuit of proper opponents.","Culture":{"Name":"Comfortable with Tech","Description":"","Source":"Force and Destiny Core Rulebook"},"Force":{"Key":"DUTYTRAD","Name":"Duty to Tradition","Description":"","Source":"Force and Destiny Core Rulebook"},"Adventure":{"Key":"RELECSTATIC","Name":"Religious Ecstatic","Description":"","Source":{"_Page":"15","__text":"Unlimited Power"}},"Indexes":{"Culture":1,"Force":1,"Adventure":62}},"Obligations":[{"Name":"Contract","Descpription":"","Toggle":true,"Obligation":"","Starting":"","Text":"Lamplighter's guild","XP5":true,"XP10":false,"C1":true,"C2":false,"Total":10,"Key":"CONTRACT","Description":"","Source":{"_Page":"18","__text":"Special Modifications"}}],"Duties":[{"Name":"","Descpription":"","Toggle":false,"Duty":"","Starting":"","Text":"","XP5":false,"XP10":false,"C1":false,"C2":false,"Total":0}],"Morality":{"Toggle":false,"XPC":false,"XP10":false,"C2":false,"StartLight":false,"StartDark":false,"Score":50,"StrengthWeakness":[{"Strength":{"Text":"","Key":null},"Weakness":{"Text":"","Key":null}}]},"Species":{"Key":"DROID","Name":"Droid","Description":"","imageUrl":"https://i.imgur.com/BLE8LI6.png","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.imgur.com/g1AeESl.png","StartingChars":{"Brawn":"1","Agility":"1","Intellect":"1","Cunning":"1","Willpower":"1","Presence":"1"},"StartingAttrs":{"WoundThreshold":"10","StrainThreshold":"10","Experience":"175"},"TalentModifiers":{"Key":"ENDUR","RankAdd":